# Funnel Skills — environment configuration
# Both keys are OPTIONAL. With neither, the skills fall back to Claude Code's
# built-in WebSearch + WebFetch tools (zero cost, slightly less depth).

# Apify token (recommended primary research source)
# Get one at https://console.apify.com/account/integrations
# Used for: Google Search Scraper, Reddit, Trustpilot, competitor scraping.
APIFY_TOKEN=

# OpenRouter key (alternate research source — single key, hits perplexity/sonar-pro)
# Get one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Used as a fallback if APIFY_TOKEN is missing but you want better research than WebSearch.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
